estore your ancestral home, form heartfelt bonds with villagers, and shapeshift into different spirit forms to explore a world that moves gently with the seasons.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, German, French, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340520/fc381c5dd7c06a922ac5be730386f7981da612df/header.jpg?t=1782983700", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340520/b5752d3640b6743cb26da9ef84e7494e649d974a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782983700", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340520/b5752d3640b6743cb26da9ef84e7494e649d974a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782983700", "website": "https://talesofseikyu.fun", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 \\ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1080 [4 GB] \\ AMD Radeon R9 380X [4 GB] \\ Intel Arc A580 [8 GB]<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> HDD</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K \\ AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 3060 [12GB] \\ AMD Radeon RX 6800 [16GB] \\ Intel Arc A580 [8GB]<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["ACE Entertainment"], "publishers": ["Fireshine Games", "Logoi